---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Iron Kingz collects and uses your information." path="/privacy">
  <div class="legal-note">This privacy policy is being finalized. For any questions about your information, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</div>

  <p>Iron Kingz LLC (“we,” “us”) respects your privacy. This policy explains what we collect when you use this website or contact us.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Information you provide:</strong> your name, email, phone, and message when you use our contact or intro-booking forms.</li>
    <li><strong>Usage information:</strong> basic analytics about how the site is used, only if/when analytics are enabled.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to enquiries and schedule introductory classes.</li>
    <li>To improve our website and programs.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share it only with service providers who help us operate (for example, a scheduling provider), as needed to deliver what you requested.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can request access to or deletion of your information by emailing <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>{site.legalName}<br />{site.addressLine}<br /><a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a></p>
</LegalLayout>
